  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 153544024064
    m_Localized: Big Roly-Poly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412672
    m_Localized: Medicine ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412673
    m_Localized: Heavy and slow. Hits harder and knocks down everyone around the
      target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412674
    m_Localized: Tennis balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412675
    m_Localized: Fly in a fan of three. The extra ones vanish when they touch the
      asphalt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412676
    m_Localized: Volleyball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412677
    m_Localized: After a hit, bounces on into two more enemies in a row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412678
    m_Localized: Boomerang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412679
    m_Localized: The ball turns around mid-flight and flies back to your hands, knocking
      down everyone on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412680
    m_Localized: On a rubber band
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412681
    m_Localized: A dropped ball jumps back into your hands by itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606976
    m_Localized: One more ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606977
    m_Localized: +1 ball in your hands and in reserve. Up to three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606978
    m_Localized: Split
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606979
    m_Localized: On the first hit the ball splits in two and keeps flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606980
    m_Localized: Sticky hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606981
    m_Localized: Catch window 35% longer, and you catch a bit farther. Up to three
      times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606982
    m_Localized: Long arms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606983
    m_Localized: Pick up balls from one and a half times farther. Up to two times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606984
    m_Localized: New sneakers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606985
    m_Localized: Run 12% faster. Up to three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606986
    m_Localized: Sandwich
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606987
    m_Localized: +1 life. Grandma sent it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928708784128
    m_Localized: Bouncy ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978432
    m_Localized: After touching the asphalt, the ball hops up and flies dangerous
      again. Up to two times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978433
    m_Localized: Hot potato
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978434
    m_Localized: After a catch, your next throw explodes and hits everyone around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978435
    m_Localized: Bubble gum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978436
    m_Localized: The ball leaves a sticky pink trail. Enemies get stuck in it and
      slow down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978437
    m_Localized: Slide tackle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978438
    m_Localized: Your dash knocks enemies off their feet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978439
    m_Localized: Hooliganism
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978440
    m_Localized: +1 damage to every throw, but one ball fewer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978441
    m_Localized: Freeze!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978442
    m_Localized: Every successful catch slows everything around for a second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978443
    m_Localized: Deflated ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978444
    m_Localized: Wobbles like a snake and grazes every enemy near its path. No sky
      catches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
